    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should call the doctor but they are super busy and i can't get an appointment for two weeks. he's already so worn out. if i just did it once or twice to kickstart it, what's the worst that would happen? it's just a supplement, not a heavy prescription drug. surely a little extra iron isn't going to hurt him if he's already low on it?",
